GIN_MANUAL","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_MAIN","id":7613901,"initDialog":761390101,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[7008],"performCfg":"QuestDialogue/WQ/NodKrai_76139/Q7613901","priority":5,"questId":76139,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":761390101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7008,"speakerName":"Dhabit","textMapHash":2249455554,"text":"The publishing trade hardly makes a living these days. Maybe I should just focus on investments...","nextNodeIds":[761390102]},{"nodeId":761390102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2583685130,"text":"Let me see the investment coupons.","nextNodeIds":[761390103]},{"nodeId":761390103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7008,"speakerName":"Dhabit","textMapHash":2906910066,"text":"Here you go. 2,000 Mora per coupon, with each investment tenure maturing weekly. Now then, into the pouch it goes...","nextNodeIds":[761390104]},{"nodeId":761390104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7008,"speakerName":"Dhabit","textMapHash":3101665434,"text":"...Ugh!","nextNodeIds":[761390105]},{"nodeId":761390105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2521036922,"text":"What's wrong?","nextNodeIds":[761390106]},{"nodeId":761390106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7008,"speakerName":"Dhabit","textMapHash":1910006594,"text":"N—No, nothing at all. I just didn't expect you to stop by, Lady Nefer. Are you... perhaps interested in buying an investment coupon too?","nextNodeIds":[761390107]},{"nodeId":761390107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1316,"speakerName":"Nefer","textMapHash":1217772330,"text":"Oh, no, I'll pass. I'm just here with my friend to have a look around.","nextNodeIds":[761390108]},{"nodeId":761390108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1316,"speakerName":"Nefer","textMapHash":446886290,"text":"I've heard your investments have been thriving, Mr. Dhabit. Seeing it with my own eyes, I can see the rumor holds true.","nextNodeIds":[761390109]},{"nodeId":761390109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7008,"speakerName":"Dhabit","textMapHash":14824610,"text":"Oh, it's nothing, nothing, haha... just a small venture to make ends meet.","nextNodeIds":[761390110]},{"nodeId":761390110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3393291394,"text":"Can this really make money?","nextNodeIds":[761390111]},{"nodeId":761390111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1316,"speakerName":"Nefer","textMapHash":3885746906,"text":"Of course. Mr. Dhabit is an excellent businessman — follow his lead, and you won't lose. Right, Mr. Dhabit?","nextNodeIds":[761390112]},{"nodeId":761390112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7008,"speakerName":"Dhabit","textMapHash":155665490,"text":"Yes, yes... haha...","nextNodeIds":[761390113]},{"nodeId":761390113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1242496658,"text":"Well then, let's see how my luck holds today.","nextNodeIds":[761390114]},{"nodeId":761390114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7008,"speakerName":"Dhabit","textMapHash":850011338,"text":"T—Today, you say... W—Well, funny that you should say that! What you've bought this fine day is our brand-new... short-term investment coupon! And here's the thing — profits and losses on this one are to be settled immediately!","nextNodeIds":[761390115]},{"nodeId":761390115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3293897994,"text":"Kinda feels like you just made all that up...","nextNodeIds":[761390116]},{"nodeId":761390116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7008,"speakerName":"Dhabit","textMapHash":46374450,"text":"Uh... Don't worry about it. A—Anyway, thanks for buying our short-term investment coupon!","nextNodeIds":[761390117]},{"nodeId":761390117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7008,"speakerName":"Dhabit","textMapHash":2510275130,"text":"Here's your investment return. Have a wonderful day!","nextNodeIds":[761390118,761390119]},{"nodeId":761390118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":874098402,"text":"Well... making money is always a good thing, I suppose...","nextNodeIds":[761390120]},{"nodeId":761390120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1108377594,"text":"Really? Heehee, then Paimon wants one shaped like a little bird! That's Paimon's favorite!","nextNodeIds":[761390121]},{"nodeId":761390121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1316,"speakerName":"Nefer","textMapHash":2034079082,"text":"Then I'll take my leave as well. Like I said, Mr. Dhabit, you've truly lived up to your reputation — an honest merchant through and through. May your business prosper.","nextNodeIds":[761390122]},{"nodeId":761390122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7008,"speakerName":"Dhabit","textMapHash":2970982138,"text":"Thank you for the kind words, Lady Nefer...","nextNodeIds":[761390123]},{"nodeId":761390123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7008,"speakerName":"Dhabit","textMapHash":2419266562,"text":"And, about that matter I asked your help with last time...","nextNodeIds":[761390124]},{"nodeId":761390124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1316,"speakerName":"Nefer","textMapHash":1491347874,"text":"We've found what you're looking for, but...","nextNodeIds":[761390125]},{"nodeId":761390125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1316,"speakerName":"Nefer","textMapHash":1755872522,"text":"Do have patience, Mr. Dhabit. One step at a time — that's how proper business is done.","nextNodeIds":[761390126]},{"nodeId":761390126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7008,"speakerName":"Dhabit","textMapHash":1366765474,"text":"O—Oh yes, you're right, of course... I'll leave it in your capable hands...","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":761390119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3634417274,"text":"Come on, Paimon, let's go buy some sugar sculptures.","nextNodeIds":[761390120]}]},{"talkId":7613902,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":true,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":true,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":false,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDuplicatedRandomTalk":false,"stayFreeStyle":false,"talkMarkHideList":[],"talkMarkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","beginCond":[{"param":["7665202","0","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_QUEST_GLOBAL_VAR_GREATER"},{"param":["7613901","2","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"}],"beginCondComb":"LOGIC_NONE","beginWay":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_MAIN","id":7613902,"initDialog":761390201,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[7008],"performCfg":"QuestDialogue/WQ/NodKrai_76139/Q7613902","priority":5,"questId":76139,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":761390201,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7008,"speakerName":"Dhabit","textMapHash":3356686674,"text":"Well, well, if it isn't our regulars! Here to invest again, are we?","nextNodeIds":[761390202]},{"nodeId":761390202,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3483986234,"text":"I'd like an investment coupon, please.","nextNodeIds":[761390203]},{"nodeId":761390203,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7008,"speakerName":"Dhabit","textMapHash":992293650,"text":"Here you go. 2,000 Mora per coupon, with each investment tenure maturing weekly. Trust me, this is... a surefire investment...","nextNodeIds":[761390204]},{"nodeId":761390204,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7008,"speakerName":"Dhabit","textMapHash":3795661058,"text":"L—Lady Nefer! I never imagined you'd grace my humble stall... H—Have you come to buy an investment coupon too?","nextNodeIds":[761390205]},{"nodeId":761390205,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1316,"speakerName":"Nefer","textMapHash":2973274866,"text":"Oh, no, I'll pass. I'm just here with my friend to have a look around.","nextNodeIds":[761390206]},{"nodeId":761390206,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1316,"speakerName":"Nefer","textMapHash":1709952450,"text":"I've heard your investments have been thriving, Mr. Dhabit. Seeing it with my own eyes, I can see the rumor holds true.","nextNodeIds":[761390207]},{"nodeId":761390207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7008,"speakerName":"Dhabit","textMapHash":846873090,"text":"Oh, it's nothing, nothing, haha... just a small venture to make ends meet.","nextNodeIds":[761390208,761390209]},{"nodeId":761390208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":383872082,"text":"Will this really yield high returns, I wonder...?","nextNodeIds":[761390210]},{"nodeId":761390210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1316,"speakerName":"Nefer","textMapHash":1241829346,"text":"Well, that's just the nature of investing — some you win, some you lose.","nextNodeIds":[761390211]},{"nodeId":761390211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1316,"speakerName":"Nefer","textMapHash":2929414746,"text":"But... at least you won't need to worry about being swindled.","nextNodeIds":[761390212]},{"nodeId":761390212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1316,"speakerName":"Nefer","textMapHash":1260460634,"text":"Mr. Dhabit is an excellent businessman, after all. Follow his lead, and you won't lose. Right, Mr. Dhabit?","nextNodeIds":[761390213]},{"nodeId":761390213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7008,"speakerName":"Dhabit","textMapHash":4140588058,"text":"Ahem! Y—Yes, yes... you're right! An honest merchant, I am! N—Naturally!","nextNodeIds":[761390214]},{"nodeId":761390214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3462030194,"text":"Well then, let's see how my luck holds today.","nextNodeIds":[761390215]},{"nodeId":761390215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7008,"speakerName":"Dhabit","textMapHash":189349938,"text":"Oh, right, I was just about to congratulate you! Remember the investment coupon you bought last time? You made quite a tidy profit on that one!","nextNodeIds":[761390216]},{"nodeId":761390216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2992241906,"text":"That's a shifty expression you've got there... You didn't just make all that up, did you?","nextNodeIds":[761390217]},{"nodeId":761390217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7008,"speakerName":"Dhabit","textMapHash":3843097362,"text":"#Ugh... Hey! I swear it's true. You've got sharp business senses, {NICKNAME}!","nextNodeIds":[761390218]},{"nodeId":761390218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7008,"speakerName":"Dhabit","textMapHash":2817143138,"text":"Here's your investment return. Have a wonderful day!","nextNodeIds":[761390219,761390220]},{"nodeId":761390219,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2834649466,"text":"Well... making money is always a good thing, I suppose...","nextNodeIds":[761390221]},{"nodeId":761390221,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2789162770,"text":"Really? Heehee, then Paimon wants one shaped like a little bird! That's Paimon's favorite!","nextNodeIds":[761390222]},{"nodeId":761390222,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1316,"speakerName":"Nefer","textMapHash":11972738,"text":"Then I'll take my leave as well. Like I said, Mr. Dhabit, you've truly lived up to your reputation — an honest merchant through and through. May your business prosper.","nextNodeIds":[761390223]},{"nodeId":761390223,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7008,"speakerName":"Dhabit","textMapHash":978257170,"text":"Thank you for the kind words, Lady Nefer...","nextNodeIds":[761390224]},{"nodeId":761390224,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7008,"speakerName":"Dhabit","textMapHash":639306258,"text":"And, about that matter I asked your help with last time...","nextNodeIds":[761390225]},{"nodeId":761390225,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1316,"speakerName":"Nefer","textMapHash":4223538018,"text":"We've found what you're looking for, but...","nextNodeIds":[761390226]},{"nodeId":761390226,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1316,"speakerName":"Nefer","textMapHash":3895308242,"text":"Do have patience, Mr. Dhabit. One step at a time — that's how proper business is done.","nextNodeIds":[761390227]},{"nodeId":761390227,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7008,"speakerName":"Dhabit","textMapHash":166610362,"text":"O—Oh yes, you're right, of course... I'll leave it in your capable hands...","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":761390220,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1038880362,"text":"Come on, Paimon, let's go buy some sugar sculptures.","nextNodeIds":[761390221]},{"nodeId":761390209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1505216202,"text":"I don't think this is going